Third-party material in this source tree
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. GNS3 appliance files (src/vasya/data/appliances/*.gns3a, 183 files)
   Taken unmodified from the GNS3 registry, https://github.com/GNS3/gns3-registry,
   snapshot commit 0c04ba6100a2fed7f25d9bac5fc289d836db27fa (2022-03-28; every
   file is byte-identical to that commit). Copyright (C) GNS3 Technologies Inc.
   and contributors. Licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3.
   packaging/payload/appliances/ holds copies of 41 of them; ntopng.gns3a there
   is the unmodified file from registry commit
   8ce90a6a35aaddb85bb10413a46fdf98f0993023 (2023-01-17).
   VASYA applies its own corrections from src/vasya/data/appliance_fixes/ when
   it creates GNS3 templates and when it builds a release; every appliance
   file changed by a build carries the notice "Modified by AdmiralGDR on
   2026-10-26 for VASYA GNS LAB (changed: ...)" in its description
   (GPL-3.0 section 5(a)).

2. Patches for GNS3 server 2.2.61 (src/vasya/data/patches/*.patch)
   Modifications of GNS3 server, https://github.com/GNS3/gns3-server, tag
   v2.2.61, Copyright (C) GNS3 Technologies Inc., GPL-3.0-or-later.
   Changed by AdmiralGDR on 2026-10-26. Each patch adds the line
   "# Modified by AdmiralGDR on 2026-10-26 for VASYA GNS LAB: ..." under the
   original copyright line of every file it changes (GPL-3.0 section 5(a)),
   and every changed hunk is marked "VASYA patch".

3. Test fixtures tests/gns3server_patch/init_su/init.sh.orig and init.sh.patched
   Copies of gns3server/compute/docker/resources/init.sh from GNS3 server
   2.2.61, Copyright (C) 2016 GNS3 Technologies Inc., GPL-3.0-or-later.
   init.sh.patched is the modified version (see item 2; it carries the
   modification notice).

4. tests/fixtures/templates/*.json
   GNS3 template records exported from GNS3 2.2.61 before and after a manual
   fix; they are data, derived from the appliance files of item 1.

The source tree contains no third-party binaries and no device images.
Helper programs, libraries, device images and Docker images are downloaded
by the installer from their upstream locations and checked against
src/vasya/data/third_party.lock. Release packages contain additional
components; they are listed with their licenses in THIRD_PARTY.md and in the
THIRD_PARTY directory of each package.

